WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.560
The sudden and urgent battle to rescue

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.520
the Princess was completed successfully.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.220
We're all so relieved!

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.780
I'm glad the Princess's 
concert went well!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:14.360
And now we will have peaceful days

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.030
ahead of us, hopefully!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.480
Yes, I hope so!

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:00.550
The morning after the battle at

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.120
Star Reading Princess

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.140
Fortress Mion
and the Princess's concert...

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:06.640
...the warriors of Galette 
that had been staying in

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.140
our territory have begun their 
retreat to their homeland.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.150
And here at the throne room 
in the Filliano Castle...

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.200
Dear Knights of Biscotti...

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.890
Not discouraged by the 
many lost battles,

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.450
you have done well for

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.450
the last two consecutive battles...

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.400
Thank you.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.120
And now to present you 
with your reward...

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.700
Leader of the Knights 
Count Rolan Martinozzi,

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:33.880
Yes, sir!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.510
You guys go all out for 
these types of things...

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.260
Hero, who do you think we are?

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.080
This is a national affair.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.760
Of course we do things properly.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.600
Leader of the Royal Guard 
Countess Eclair Martinozzi...

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.400
Yes, sir!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.990
Eclair. You fought well in the battles

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:59.600
and took care of the Hero...

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.360
I am grateful for all you have done.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.480
And you were the first to come to

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:05.750
my rescue in the battle to get me back.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.450
No, I...

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.210
Thank you, Eclair.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:14.210
You are too generous...

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.090
Look at Eclair, she's in heaven...

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.590
The Princess is a genius 
at patting heads.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.890
She can make anyone feel truly happy.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.570
And so before you knew it

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:30.840
several days had gone by

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.360
Oh, the Hero and Rico, welcome!

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.160
Sorry to bother you!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:51.510
Here you go.
The usual scrap meat...

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:52.960
you can put them in a sandwich.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.330
Thank you very much!

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.500
Oh, and I have a treat 
for the Knights...

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.590
Would you mind taking this to them?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:01.570
Certainly!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.140
There's enough for the two of you!

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.760
You're too kind!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:10.310
This smell... today's 
treat is honey tarts...

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.770
Mmm smell so delicious!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:15.600
Rico, um I mean girls really 
like sweet stuff don't they.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.480
I am a girl and use my brain a lot...

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.820
...so I need lots of sugar!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.680
Oh, the Hero and the Chief Researcher, 
running errands yourselves?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:37.840
No problem!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.340
Everyone, we have a 
treat from the kitchen!

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.420
Yes, sir!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:46.280
Eclair! We brought treats!

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.300
Oh, um I'm alright.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.840
Really? That's so unlike you!

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.020
I just really want to train more.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.810
Oh, then shall I be your opponent?

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:58.060
Good idea!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.650
Hero, will you be her opponent again?

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:01.940
Of course!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.020
Everyone, watch carefully.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:07.020
The Hero and the Leader of the 
Royal Guard is going to fight.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:07.820
Yes, sir!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.330
...So what weapon are you using today?

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.540
This one!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.430
I'm using the sword!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.680
Humph! Show off..., very well...

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:34.940
Come on!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:35.680
Alright!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.450
It looks like Eclair 
is enjoying herself.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.500
I don't like to praise 
my own sister too much,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.170
young knights that can 
match her in ability...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:03.300
It's a good thing that she's 
found a worthy opponent.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.500
They are close in age,

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.940
...Just now,

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.650
I felt a chill run down my spine
and had a really bad feeling...

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.150
Really, I didn't feel anything.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.690
Maybe you caught a cold?

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:34.740
You look like you might 
sleep with your tummy out...

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.450
You stupid Hero!

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:49.010
How dare you touch a knight's 
forehead without permission!

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.430
I, I'm sorry!

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.260
They look like they're getting along.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:58.270
Huh? Um, I suppose so...

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.190
Agh, that was terrible...

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.790
Don't you think she was 
terrible, that Eclair...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:14.030
-Oh well! Doggies, lead the way!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.710
Yukki!

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.460
-Hello!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.720
Oh, the Hero!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.350
Oyakata-sama!

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.100
Countess Dalkian, hello!

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:42.600
Hey. Today's a great day for fishing!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.770
We thought that Biscotti 
might be facing hard times,

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.280
so we cut our search short 
and came back, but...

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:52.490
...I guess there was no need to worry...

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:57.240
The Hero and Eclair did a great job.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.500
But, Hero, you really are 
an interesting person.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.710
Me, really?

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.250
From what I heard, you've only 
been in Biscotti a few days...

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.510
...but the knights, 
and Rico and everyone

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.240
in the castle already 
trust you completely.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:17.010
Uhh, well Eclair is always 
hitting and kicking me...

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.520
That's just shows how 
much she trusts you...

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.310
Well, I hope so!

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.520
Oh, looks like you caught something!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.600
You're right!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.240
Whoa! It's big! Whoaaa!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.030
That is quite a catch!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.870
Here it comes!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.550
Yukki, sorry!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.130
Can you cook that up too?

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.470
Of course!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.700
Come to think of it,

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.520
Yes...

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.230
So will you be returning 
to your homeland someday?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.770
Or will you stay here permanently?

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.190
...Oh no!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.650
I'd forgotten it almost completely!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:19.480
I hadn't found a way to get home yet!

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:23.250
Huh? Yukki, what did you say just now?

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:26.080
Uh, I asked if you were going home...

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.990
It is common knowledge 
in these parts that when

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.100
a hero is summoned, he cannot 
return to his world...

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:36.000
...but in other lands far away, 
there are stories of heroes

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.260
that have done their part 
and returned to their homes.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:39.930
Is that true?

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.070
Oh, thank you...

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:46.020
Rico said she has gotten to 
that point in her research...

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.480
Oh, I see...

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.940
Hero, you must have family back home?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.380
Yes. My father and mother,

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.720
and my relatives and friends...

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.080
-I see...

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:00.620
Oh! Looks like the fish is ready!

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.330
I will go get it.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.160
Let me help!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.670
I wonder how Becky is doing?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.670
Rebecca, Rebecca?

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.170
Rebecca?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.870
If you're there then say something.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.730
And clean up your room, it's a mess!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:33.020
Really, You're being so lazy 
now that Sink isn't around.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.940
This has nothing to do with him!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.730
Stupid Sink...

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:42.090
He usually texts me all the time...

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:44.450
I'm worried because they 
stop coming so sudden...

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:49.160
Oh well, it's Sink so he's 
probably having a great time

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.470
running around wherever he is...

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:55.800
Oh, I haven't checked 
my fortune in a while...

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.300
Um my fortune is...

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.300
Fortune Telling Pavillion

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.670
"Not good, not bad..."

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.940
And Sink's is...

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.310
"This week will be the worst ever...

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.560
"There will be an unexpected 
misfortune occurs at every turn"?!

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:20.990
Oh, Rolan?

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.240
Yes, Princess.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:25.060
The Hero, what was he doing today?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.110
Princess... You ask that question

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.330
every day
to everyone you meet...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:36.750
I believe he is visiting Countess 
Dalkian at her place...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.630
I see...

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.760
Does Brioche like the 
Hero, do you think?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:42.530
Yes.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.370
She,Yukikaze, and the Secret Troops
 enjoy his company.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:46.640
I see...

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.510
Princess...

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:52.210
You have some time after your lessons

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.380
Why don't you take some time to speak

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.730
with the Hero then?

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.900
Oh, really?

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.240
Isn't it, the Leader of the Knights?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.350
Yes, I have already let the Hero know.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.330
Thank you Rolan, Amelita!

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:18.080
The Leader of the Knights is waiting,

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:20.700
Yes!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:21.990
Your Highness.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:23.300
Yes!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.980
Excuse us!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:34.430
Oh, sorry to disturb you!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.810
Once we enter the city,

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.570
It can't be helped.
 He's big like me.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:50.580
Well, I'm going to drop in 
at the knight headquarters.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.010
-Hero, you have a meeting 
with the princess.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:54.670
Yes.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.840
Make sure you mind your manners.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.340
Don't worry!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.010
Well, we're the Princess's 
Personal Maid Team!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:12.600
Start!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.890
-Yes!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.480
Oh, no! Hey, stop it! Stop!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:17.850
We won't stop.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.720
You were running around all day,

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.270
Princess in that state...

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:27.660
I, Riselle Conkirie, leader of the maids,
 will not allow it!

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:30.660
Hey, I can wash myself!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:33.100
Please stop complaining!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.670
Princess, the Hero has arrived.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.670
Please bring him in.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.180
Good evening...

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.020
Good evening, Hero!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.270
Yes...

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.240
It's a little chilly today...

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.550
I made us some tea.

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:05.560
Do you like sweet tea?

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:06.570
I love it!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.200
I'm glad.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.890
The tea in Biscotti is delicious.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.820
It smells like fruit.

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:16.600
Tea is one of our best products.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:20.790
They are a luxury item in 
some countries far away.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.000
I'm not surprised.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.760
Um, Hero?

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.100
Please allow me to apologize again,

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:36.300
Oh, no. Please don't worry!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.630
and I'm having fun.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.440
Really?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.960
A Hero never lies!

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.110
And haven't you heard from Rico?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:50.790
It looks like she can find 
a way to get me home...

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.030
So there's nothing for 
you to worry about!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.370
Okay...

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.940
And I have something I wanted 
to ask you, Princess.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:14:59.830
Yes?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.130
Why did you choose me 
to summon as your hero?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.300
Oh, ummm... well...

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.630
Oh, if it's a secret or 
something, I understand...

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:15.610
Umm, it's not a secret but... ummm.

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:16.140
Yes?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:20.340
Hero, do you know what star reading is?

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.340
Star reading?

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.480
It's a form of seal power,

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:27.260
and you can see different 
things using a video board.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.690
Different things?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.660
Things from a world far, 
far away... for some,

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:35.410
even a bit of the future.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.440
Wow!

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:38.460
Of course, when I say 
you can see things,

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:44.170
...and you can't just see 
whatever you want to.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.380
I see.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:49.520
And, well I can do a 
little star reading...

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:54.520
...so I was watching things 
from a world far from Flonyald.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.760
There was this silver battleground 
that looked like a castle...

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:04.190
And there was one hero who 
was fighting so heroically...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.140
He had golden hair...

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.880
...and he was small

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.230
but his movements were so 
strong and beautiful...

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:19.910
He was trying so hard, 
he was so focused...

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.370
I wished that someone like him

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.920
would be the hero of our nation...

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.340
well that's what I thought...

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.100
Huh? Hero?!

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:35.110
Uhh, the me that you saw...

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:38.220
was I wearing a black 
shirt with flames on it?

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.050
Yes, you did.

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:43.100
That was the match that I lost...

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:48.570
The battle in my world is
a match called Iron Athletics.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.590
The one who won was a

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:54.700
pretty girl, a little 
older than you, wasn't it?

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.330
Yes... she's a relative, 
my master and my rival...

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:02.350
So... you were watching that...

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.670
Oh I'm sorry! I shouldn't have...

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.270
Oh, no. It was broadcast on TV...

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:09.210
so I don't mind...

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.240
It's just that I lost to 
Nanami in the final leg...

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.720
I tried hard but it wasn't enough...

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.810
I was upset that I couldn't overcome
the two-second difference in our times.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.770
I felt bad for my family 
and friends who were

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.810
cheering for me... I felt ashamed...

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.780
...so I was crying, I 
was really bawling...

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.050
But!

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:36.320
Those tears you cried 
were beautiful tears!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.500
They were the tears of someone

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.680
who did his best, who gave his all...

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:43.080
They were precious, beautiful tears...

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:46.760
That is why I chose you to 
be our hero over anyone else,

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.040
Oh! Umm, I mean

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:56.390
"I wanted to summon you, 
our Hero, as our hero"...

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:58.010
...does that sound strange?

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.310
Um, please call me Sink.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.600
Sink... sama?

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.740
Just Sink.

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:08.930
Yes... Um,

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:13.470
I wanted Sink to come 
more than anyone else...

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:18.730
I wished that Sink would 
be our nation's hero.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.270
Thank you, Princess.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.210
I'm sorry Countess Dalkian.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.050
I don't mind.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.910
I was away for more than a year

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.140
I must do every bit that I can.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:46.180
You were never one to be 
tied down to any nation...

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.420
But I'm thankful that you have

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.870
declared yourself as 
a citizen of Biscotti.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.050
You think too much of me...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:00.360
This time, you'll stay 
a while, won't you?

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:06.680
The future of my search depends

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:09.080
on Yukikaze's star reading...

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.300
I can't say anything for sure...

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.000
But I would like to stay 
as long as possible...

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.120
And, I feel there is 
something suspicious

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:27.270
about our neighbor, Galette.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.460
Yes... I can't read 
stars but it is obvious

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:34.310
that Galette has been waging 
battles too often...

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.280
Galette, yes but...

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:41.280
it's more like Princess 
Leo is up to something...

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.160
Yes... I don't want to think so...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.370
...but I fear that some sort 
of demon is involved...

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:52.790
If so then...

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:56.240
It will truly be my turn to fight.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.960
Well then, Sink.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:04.730
Tomorrow morning? You promise?

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.690
Yes! 6 o'clock at the rear gate.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.940
Princess... Have you made 
a promise to the Hero?

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.940
He's going to join me 
on my morning walk...

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.450
Sink says he doesn't 
mind getting up early!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.620
Is that so.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.980
You must be looking 
forward to your walk.

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:28.910
Yes!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.280
Going on walks together...

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.260
Damn! Again?!

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.600
I finished the battle, but 
nothing has changed...

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.770
No, it's gotten worse!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:58.840
My star reading power 
shouldn't be so strong...

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:00.990
why is it then...

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.240
Why can I see the future so clearly?

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:15.230
Princess Millefiore, the lady of Exelede,
and Hero Sink, the lord of Palladion..

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:18.310
...will die in 30 days

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:20.480
The future you see will not
 change under any circumstances.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.940
Not only Millefi but the 
Hero is going to die...

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.370
I don't care if it is the future 
destined in the stars...

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:33.600
I will use you, Granvert!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.270
The heavens and the stars,

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:50.470
It was the following day 
that Her Majesty Leo made

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:52.730
a surprising announcement to Biscotti...

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:56.230
...and the surrounding nations.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:31.650
Maid Unit!

00:23:31.650 --> 00:23:32.680
Do it!

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:33.820
OK!

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:36.990
There there.

00:23:35.370 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Declaration of War</b>

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:36.990
My socks!

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:40.190
Not a single wasteful move - impressive.
